      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Row-Haan and this video is about how AI image generators like Midjourney turn random noise into a picture. You type a prompt, and moments later there are four images that never existed before. Nothing was searched for, and nothing was pasted together. Every one of them started as static.",
