    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "MEASURED",
      "narration_text": "So I trained one myself. A tiny model, on my laptop, with no graphics card. Twelve thousand little pictures of hearts and music notes, each sixteen pixels across, and about half an hour of training. Then I gave it pure static, asked for a heart, and let it take a thousand small steps. At first it's only guessing. By the last step, there's a heart.",
