    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "SEED AND PROMPT",
      "narration_text": "Now watch what the seed does. Keep the same static, but change the prompt to a music note, and the same noise becomes a note. Keep the prompt, change the seed, and you get a different heart every time. That's why Midjourney shows you four pictures. One prompt, four different starting points.",
