    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "WHAT TO DO",
      "narration_text": "So here's how to use this. When you're testing a change to your prompt, lock the seed. Midjourney's guide calls it a control in an experiment: now the only thing that changed is your words. But don't use a seed to keep a style or a character. It only sets the starting static, and Midjourney says it has the least effect of anything. For that, use style references.",
